          "index": 7,
          "previous": {
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "The retained receipt distinguishes issuer, actual redeemer, Store, Employee and purchasing owner. Participation admission alone does not complete cross-Enterprise item/priced benefit fulfillment, financial settlement or merchant guarantees. Existing issuer/Store provider assumptions remain enforced until their v2 integration is qualified; there is no bypass or generic external-partner adapter."
          },
          "updated": {
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "The retained receipt distinguishes issuer, actual redeemer, Store, Employee and purchasing owner. With integrated merchant benefits disabled and Digital's effective standard merchant-screen provider explicitly selected, authorized staff may mark an externally used monetary or ITEM coupon redeemed, including at an accepted other Enterprise. Fresh staff/outlet authority, retained participation, exact terms, expiry and single-use guards remain mandatory. The receipt is staff attestation only, not independently verified delivery or discount application; Nodics performs no delivery, bill calculation or automatic reimbursement/settlement in this flow. Integrated item/priced fulfillment remains separate and requires its own qualified evidence; missing evidence cannot fall back to staff recording."
          },
          "authority": "User P09 source reconciliation, exact wording confirmed by Promotion owner Harvey.",
          "sourceContract": "nodics.commerce/modules/baseCommerce/modules/promotion/llm/contracts/verified-item-benefits.md#staff-recording-of-external-use"
        }
      ]
